 lH-imidazolyl, especially lH-imidazol-2-yl, lH-imidazol-4-yl, more especially Cι_6al yl substituted imidazolyl, even more especially 1 -methyl- lH-imidazol-2-yl, 1- methy 1- 1 H-imidazol-4-y 1 ; lH-[l,2,4]triazolyl, especially lH-[l,2,4]triazol-3-yl, more especially Ci.galkyl substituted lH-[l,2,4]triazolyl, even more especially 5-methyl-lH-[l,2,4]triazol-3-yl.

R is selected from the group consisting of: methyl, especially halogenated methyl, more especially trifluoromethyl, especially alkoxy substituted methyl, more especially phenoxy-methyl, 4-fluoro-phenoxy-methyl, especially heterocycle substituted methyl, more especially 2-thiophenyl-methyl; butyl, especially aryl substituted butyl, more especially 4-(4-methoxy)phenyl-butyl; isopentyl; cyclohexyl; pentanonyl, especially 4-pentanonyl; butenyl, especially aryl substituted butenyl, more especially 4,4-bis(4- methoxyphenyl)-but-3-enyl; acetyl; 

